{"overview":"این سریال داستان‌های برخی از شخصیت‌هایی را که در مرکز خرید خیالی سنتووتری‌نه در مرکز تورین کار می‌کنند یا به آن مرتبط هستند، روایت می‌کند؛ داستان‌های عشق و شور و اشتیاق، اما همچنین مبارزات برای قدرت و دعواهای سلسله‌وار در این تلویزیون‌فیلم وجود دارد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The series tells the stories of some of the characters who work or are related to an imaginary shopping center Centovetrine, located in the center of Turin. There are many stories of love and passion, but also struggles for power and dynastic quarrels in the telefilm.","tagline_en":"","runtime":20,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":230,"y":2001,"poster":""},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":230,"y":null,"poster":""},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":230,"y":null,"poster":""},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":230,"y":null,"poster":""},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":230,"y":null,"poster":""},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":230,"y":null,"poster":""},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":230,"y":null,"poster":""},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":230,"y":null,"poster":""},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":230,"y":null,"poster":""},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":230,"y":null,"poster":""},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":232,"y":null,"poster":""},{"n":12,"name":"فصل 12","ep":228,"y":2011,"poster":""},{"n":13,"name":"فصل 13","ep":174,"y":2012,"poster":""},{"n":14,"name":"فصل 14","ep":192,"y":2013,"poster":""},{"n":15,"name":"فصل 15","ep":192,"y":2014,"poster":""}],"episodes":3318,"crew":["Cristiana Farina"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["IT"],"cast":[{"name":"Roberto Alpi","role":"Ettore Ferri","photo":"/tyigCfwwYXAOwVZVotyH4V7PlG.jpg"},{"name":"Elisabetta Coraini","role":"Laura Beccaria","photo":"/1Gk6kdplo4MuCgHXz4TgReyhdBF.jpg"},{"name":"Marianna De Micheli","role":"Carol Grimani","photo":"/i2zjclUDVqV6yhLkeKvt5xG2Fza.jpg"},{"name":"Michele D'Anca","role":"Sebastian Castelli","photo":"/st43z86rCXjShl7PhylXciz8Yy7.jpg"},{"name":"Alessandro Mario","role":"Marco Della Rocca/Lorenzo Marasco","photo":"/nu4lqENR8qTHysryeksfnicvQEe.j